+//! Open implementation of the workspace object storage API (`/w/:id/job_helpers`)
+//! and of the helpers that `apps.rs`, `args.rs` and the HTTP trigger handler
+//! call. Written against the 1.601.1 open types in `windmill_common::s3_helpers`
+//! (object_store 0.12, datafusion 47); the last open upstream version of this
+//! file (Feb 2024, polars based) served as the design reference.
+//!
+//! Permission model: the workspace storage setting carries an optional ordered
+//! list of glob rules (`advanced_permissions`). When present they are applied to
+//! every path a non-admin user touches; workspace admins bypass them. A `public`
+//! storage resource is read with instance rights so users without access to the
+//! underlying resource can still use the storage.
+
